{
  "description": "MOB-001 workspace classification and resolution fixtures from docs/MOBILE_PWA.md sections 2 and 4. Consumed by src/JulOS.Desktop/src/workspace-contract.test.ts and available to the server-side resolution MOB-003/MOB-004 adds.",
